      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been feeling really wiped out lately and my legs keep cramping up like crazy at night. i think my potassium might be low. im in stage 3 CKD so i have to be careful, but do u think i should start taking a potassium supplement to help with the cramps? like maybe one of those 99mg ones a few times a day?",
