      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks... that makes me feel a bit better. i was really worried about it. should i just take them with food or on an empty stomach? also i saw some people online saying taking like 5 or 6 a day helps faster if the cramps are really bad, do you think that might be okay too if i do it for just a day or two?",
